WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:03.840
Now, I know from experience that at times
you can feel as if you're not making any

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.680
progress. You feel you've put a lot of
effort into it, you've been reading and

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:10.800
listening perhaps more than once,
reviewing your words and you still

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.040
forget them, and you still can't make
sense of what you're reading or

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:19.230
listening to. That's normal.
However, in order to make sure you stay

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:23.400
positive, which is so important ,you'll
remember the three keys, attitude is so

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:28.260
important, we have a lot of statistics
at LingQ, which show you that even

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:32.309
though at times you feel you're not
moving very quickly, if you see how many

00:00:32.309 --> 00:00:38.040
words you've saved, how many words you've
read, the various statistics: learn... words

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:42.450
learned and so forth refer, to them from
time to time, because it's very important

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:47.399
to stay positive. There are moments when
you all of a sudden say "wow", you know "a

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:51.000
month ago I couldn't make sense of this
and now it's clear to me". But there are

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.570
other times when you feel as if you're
not getting anywhere, and that's where

00:00:54.570 --> 00:01:00.270
it's so important to stay positive and
check against your goals and see just

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:05.030
how much you actually have achieved.

